def sizeA : (Ran SPi w _ (Lan SMu A [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) Nat) := (Sec SPi w a (Lan SMu A [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) [a => (Elim SMu A [] a as self return Nat with | (ACtor leaf)  => 0 | (ACtor node) b => (Out SPi w b Nat (APt w (Out SPi w _ (Lan SMu B [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) (APt w b) sizeB)) (Out SPi w a Nat (APt w 1) natAdd)))])
def sizeB : (Ran SPi w _ (Lan SMu B [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) Nat) := (Sec SPi w b (Lan SMu B [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) [b => (Elim SMu B [] b as self return Nat with | (ACtor bridge) c => (Out SPi w b Nat (APt w (Out SPi w _ (Lan SMu C [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) (APt w c) sizeC)) (Out SPi w a Nat (APt w 1) natAdd)))])
def sizeC : (Ran SPi w _ (Lan SMu C [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) Nat) := (Sec SPi w c (Lan SMu C [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) [c => (Elim SMu C [] c as self return Nat with | (ACtor again) a => (Out SPi w b Nat (APt w (Out SPi w _ (Lan SMu A [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) (APt w a) sizeA)) (Out SPi w a Nat (APt w 1) natAdd)))])
def main : Nat := (Out SPi w _ (Lan SMu A [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) (APt w (In SMu A [] (ACtor node) [(In SMu B [] (ACtor bridge) [(In SMu C [] (ACtor again) [(In SMu A [] (ACtor leaf) [])])])])) sizeA)
